pan>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 1st November</div>                                                <li class=\"sub\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627697\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:05 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag sub\">SUB</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/8242298/suspiria-1977\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/8242298.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/8242298/suspiria-1977\" target=\"\">Suspiria [1977]</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1977</span>                                        <span>99mins</span>                                        <span>Italy</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Dario Argento</span>                                        <span>Starring Jessica Harper, Stefania Casini, Flavio Bucci</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Suzy (Jessica Harper) travels to Germany to attend ballet school. When she arrives, late on a stormy night, no one lets her in, and she sees Pat (Eva Axén), another student, fleeing from the school. When Pat reaches her apartment, she is murdered. The next day, Suzy is admitted to her new school, but has a difficult time settling in. She hears noises, and often feels ill. As more people die, Suzy uncovers the terrifying secret history of the place.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 4th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627851\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627488\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">9:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 11th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627500\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 13th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627568\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">1:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 22nd October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627619\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 25th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627644\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 28th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627668\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row live-score\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/27891468/the-cabinet-of-dr-caligari-live-score\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/27891468.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/27891468/the-cabinet-of-dr-caligari-live-score\" target=\"\">The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari (Live Score)</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1920</span>                                        <span>77mins</span>                                        <span>Germany</span>                                        <span>(U)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Robert Wiene</span>                                        <span>Starring Conrad Veidt, Friedrich Fehér, Hans Heinz v. Twardowski, Lil Dagover, Rudolf Lettinger, Werner Krauss</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><b>This performance will feature a live score performed by Hugo Max</b>\r\n<br /><p>\r\n</p><p>The rich timbre of the viola perfectly captures the aura of Robert Wiene's The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari. My improvisations translate the film's angular painted shadows into unnerving melodies inspired by musical techniques that were evolving during the 1920s. The nefarious showmanship of Caligari invites theatrical and macabre sounds, in contrast with ghostly gestures evoking ‘the somnambulist' who is compelled to act against his will.\r\n<br /></p><p>\r\n</p><p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z7rvOLnMpGM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n<br /></p><p>\r\n</p><p>THE CABINET OF DR. CALIGARI : One of the most iconic masterpieces in cinema history, Robert Wiene's Das Cabinet des Dr Caligari shook filmgoers worldwide and changed the direction of the art form. Now presented in a definitive restoration, the film's chilling, radically expressionist vision is set to grip viewers again.\r\n<br /></p><p>\r\n</p><p>At a local carnival in a small German town, hypnotist Dr. Caligari presents the somnambulist Cesare, who can purportedly predict the future of curious fairgoers. But at night, the doctor wakes Cesare from his sleep to enact his evil bidding…\r\n<br /></p><p>\r\n</p><p>Incalculably influential, the film's nightmarishly jagged sets, sinister atmospheric and psychological emphasis left an immediate impact in its wake (horror, film noir, and gothic cinema would all be shaped directly by it).</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 4th October</div>                                                <li class=\"live-score\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31626004\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">5:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag live-score\">LIVE SCORE</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 23rd October</div>                                                <li class=\"live-score\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31626006\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag live-score\">LIVE SCORE</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3226239/a-nightmare-on-elm-street\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3226239.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3226239/a-nightmare-on-elm-street\" target=\"\">A Nightmare On Elm Street</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1984</span>                                        <span>89mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Wes Craven</span>                                        <span>Starring Johnny Depp, Heather Langenkamp, Robert Englund</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>In Wes Craven's classic slasher film, several Midwestern teenagers fall prey to Freddy Krueger (Robert Englund), a disfigured midnight mangler who preys on the teenagers in their dreams -- which, in turn, kills them in reality. After investigating the phenomenon, Nancy (Heather Langenkamp) begins to suspect that a dark secret kept by her and her friends' parents may be the key to unraveling the mystery, but can Nancy and her boyfriend Glen (Johnny Depp) solve the puzzle before it's too late?</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 4th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627533\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:25 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627559\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 27th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627663\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">1:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row premiere\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617469/nadja-4k-restoration-london-premiere\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/9RHN4m7kjialpSkEBb6s1bkzJJjjAk-usa_RxXVqf9k.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617469/nadja-4k-restoration-london-premiere\" target=\"\">Nadja • 4K Restoration • London Premiere</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1994</span>                                        <span>93mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Drama</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Michael Almereyda</span>                                        <span>Starring Elina Lowensohn, Suzy Amis, Galaxy Craze, David Lynch</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>In 1993, invited by David Lynch to come up with a low-budget genre movie, Michael Almereyda (Tesla, Experimenter, Hamlet) came up with a moody, postmodern reimagining of the Dracula myth which draws inspiration from Dracula&rsquo;s Daughter (1936) and Andr&eacute; Breton&rsquo;s surrealist novel Nadja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The film follows estranged vampire twins Nadja (Elina L&ouml;wensohn) and Edgar (a young Jared Harris) as they reunite following their father&rsquo;s death by the flamboyantly unhinged Dr. Van Helsing, played with relish by Peter Fonda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The film&rsquo;s striking visuals combine high-contrast black-and-white 35mm cinematography with the hallucinatory grain of Pixelvision video, looking better than ever in this new 4K restoration of the director&rsquo;s cut.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#2ecc71\"><em><strong>London Premiere of the New 4K restoration of the director&rsquo;s cut c/o Arbelos Films and Radiance Films.</strong></em></span></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 4th October</div>                                                <li class=\"premiere\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627714\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:35 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag premiere\">PREMIERE</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 29th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627676\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:20 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 35mm\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3502625/cruising\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3502625.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3502625/cruising\" target=\"\">Cruising</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1980</span>                                        <span>102mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Crime / Thriller</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by William Friedkin</span>                                        <span>Starring Al Pacino, Karen Allen, Paul Sorvino</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>There&rsquo;s a killer on the loose in New York City, and he&rsquo;s targeting gay men in the West Village. Fortunately for the NYPD, he&rsquo;s got a type &ndash; slim, dark-haired, handsome &ndash; and officer Steve Burns (Al Pacino) fits the bill. To crack the case, Steve must journey into the city&rsquo;s nocturnal underworld of S&amp;M and leather bars, hoping to catch the killer&rsquo;s eye &ndash; but will he lose himself along the way? Controversial with both straight and gay audiences upon its initial release, Friedkin&rsquo;s film still retains its power to shock and unsettle 45 years later.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627538\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 20th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627604\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617464/the-howling\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/7bXCKoBbguymsSb8QoGM-pWJAnTkYldFgRO9sH13LWE.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617464/the-howling\" target=\"\">The Howling</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1981</span>                                        <span>91mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Joe Dante</span>                                        <span>Starring Dee Wallace, Patrick Macnee, Dennis Dugan</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>After a bizarre and near fatal encounter with a serial killer, a newswoman is sent to a rehabilitation center whose inhabitants may not be what they seem.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627540\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">1:05 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3638987/wake-in-fright-4k-restoration\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/3Omxrcu02K2cxOhdLAliiG50C9B-yKws-lfw92YquGg.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3638987/wake-in-fright-4k-restoration\" target=\"\">Wake in Fright - 4K Restoration</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1971</span>                                        <span>108mins</span>                                        <span>Australia, USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Psychological Thriller</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Ted Kotcheff</span>                                        <span>Starring Donald Pleasence, Gary Bond, Chips Rafferty</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>After finishing up the school term in a remote outback town, teacher John Grant (Gary Bond) looks forward to spending his holiday with his girlfriend in Sydney. But John gets waylaid in a mining town where a gambling spree leaves him completely broke. He quickly falls in with the hard-drinking locals, who constantly ply him with alcohol and force him to participate in a gruesome kangaroo hunt. Disgusted, John tries to hitchhike out of town and, when that fails, begins to contemplate suicide.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627537\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 1st December</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627950\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Monday 7th December</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628048\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617463/underworld\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/v-PUEN-Y5yDeFZ6qwNoQaB5kRn60fRF7AoxRfKp5cIo.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617463/underworld\" target=\"\">Underworld</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2003</span>                                        <span>122mins</span>                                        <span>Germany, Hungary, UK, USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Action</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Len Wiseman</span>                                        <span>Starring Kate Beckinsale, Scott Speedman, Michael Sheen</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Vampires and werewolves have waged a nocturnal war against each other for centuries. But all bets are off when a female vampire warrior named Selene, who's famous for her strength and werewolf-hunting prowess, becomes smitten with a peace-loving male werewolf, Michael, who wants to end the war.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627539\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/2631783/the-thing\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/2631783.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/2631783/the-thing\" target=\"\">The Thing</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1982</span>                                        <span>108mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Sci-Fi / Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by John Carpenter</span>                                        <span>Starring Kurt Russell, Wilford Brimley, Keith David</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>In remote Antarctica, a group of American research scientists are disturbed at their base camp by a helicopter shooting at a sled dog. When they take in the dog, it brutally attacks both human beings and canines in the camp and they discover that the beast can assume the shape of its victims. A resourceful helicopter pilot (Kurt Russell) and the camp doctor (Richard Dysart) lead the camp crew in a desperate, gory battle against the vicious creature before it picks them all off, one by one.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627481\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627550\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:50 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627558\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:20 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 13th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627569\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 18th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627592\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">2:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 24th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627634\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Monday 26th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627650\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 30th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627679\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 31st October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627687\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">10:15 am</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 1st November</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627696\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:10 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 1-mem\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/18835989/teen-wolf\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/V-m-RyIl7_cDUjvbBH1p_O_vB6p9ovvm6-bo579oc2I.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/18835989/teen-wolf\" target=\"\">Teen Wolf</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1985</span>                                        <span>91mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(PG)</span>                                        <span>Comedy / Sport</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Rod Daniel</span>                                        <span>Starring Michael J. Fox, James Hampton, Jerry Levine, Susan Ursitti, Lorie Griffin</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p><strong>* ON SALE 23rd SEPT *&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>When a shy teenager&rsquo;s newfound powers help him score at basketball - and with the popular girls - he has some pretty hairy decisions to make.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"1-mem\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627536\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:25 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 1-mem\">£1 MEM</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/311142/an-american-werewolf-in-london\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/311142.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/311142/an-american-werewolf-in-london\" target=\"\">An American Werewolf in London</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1981</span>                                        <span>97mins</span>                                        <span>UK, USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Comedy</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by John Landis</span>                                        <span>Starring David Naughton, Jenny Agutter, Griffin Dunne</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>David (David Naughton) and Jack (Griffin Dunne), two American college students, are backpacking through Britain when a large wolf attacks them. David survives with a bite, but Jack is brutally killed. As David heals in the hospital, he's plagued by violent nightmares of his mutilated friend, who warns David that he is becoming a werewolf. When David discovers the horrible truth, he contemplates committing suicide before the next full moon causes him to transform from man to murderous beast.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627482\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 20th October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627608\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 35mm\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/19405985/trouble-every-day\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/19405985.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/19405985/trouble-every-day\" target=\"\">Trouble Every Day</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2001</span>                                        <span>102mins</span>                                        <span>France, Germany, Japan</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Erotic</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Claire Denis</span>                                        <span>Starring Vincent Gallo, Alex Descas, Beatrice Dalle, Tricia Vessey</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Scientist Shane Brown (Vincent Gallo) neglects his new bride (Tricia Vessey), instead spending their honeymoon searching for an old colleague who disappeared after a research paper he had written was discredited by the medical community. It turns out that Dr. Semeneau is living in obscurity in order to protect his wife (Béatrice Dalle), whom he keeps prisoner in a room with boards nailed across the doorway. The narrative unfolds the dark secret that drives each party.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 5th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627535\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639423/hellraiser\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3639423.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639423/hellraiser\" target=\"\">Hellraiser</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1987</span>                                        <span>94mins</span>                                        <span>UK</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Clive Barker</span>                                        <span>Starring Andrew Robinson, Clare Higgins, Ashley Laurence</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Sexual deviant Frank (Sean Chapman) inadvertently opens a portal to hell when he tinkers with a box he bought while abroad. The act unleashes gruesome beings called Cenobites, who tear Frank&#39;s body apart. When Frank&#39;s brother (Andrew Robinson) and his wife, Julia (Clare Higgins), move into Frank&#39;s old house, they accidentally bring what is left of Frank back to life. Frank then convinces Julia, his one-time lover, to lure men back to the house so he can use their blood to reconstruct himself.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 6th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627542\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617459/obsession-2026\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/wRj24muuaHHZxKb09P-vpMYA2b_4pf6RayNzDHqp_UY.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617459/obsession-2026\" target=\"\">Obsession (2026)</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>108mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Thriller</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Curry Barker</span>                                        <span>Starring Michael Johnston, Inde Navarrette, Cooper Tomlinson</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>After breaking the mysterious \"One Wish Willow\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 6th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627484\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Monday 26th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627652\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 35mm\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31616838/irreversible\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/31616838.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31616838/irreversible\" target=\"\">Irreversible</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2002</span>                                        <span>97mins</span>                                        <span>France</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Thriller</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Gaspar Noé</span>                                        <span>Starring Monica Bellucci, Vincent Cassel, Albert Dupontel</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>A woman's lover and her ex-boyfriend take justice into their own hands after she becomes the victim of a rapist. Because some acts can't be undone. Because man is an animal. Because the desire for vengeance is a natural impulse. Because most crimes remain unpunished.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 6th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627545\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:20 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 35mm\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3649033/the-exorcist-extended-cut\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3649033.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3649033/the-exorcist-extended-cut\" target=\"\">The Exorcist (Extended Cut)</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1973</span>                                        <span>132mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by William Friedkin</span>                                        <span>Starring Ellen Burstyn, Linda Blair, Max von Sydow</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>One of the most profitable horror movies ever made, this tale of an exorcism is based loosely on actual events. When young Regan (Linda Blair) starts acting odd -- levitating, speaking in tongues -- her worried mother (Ellen Burstyn) seeks medical help, only to hit a dead end. A local priest (Jason Miller), however, thinks the girl may be seized by the devil. The priest makes a request to perform an exorcism, and the church sends in an expert (Max von Sydow) to help with the difficult job.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 6th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627483\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627491\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 18th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627591\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">11:50 am</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 21st October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627612\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 24th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627636\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">2:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 27th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627660\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:10 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 28th October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627665\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/2423/the-room\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/2423.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/2423/the-room\" target=\"\">The Room</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2003</span>                                        <span>99mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Romance/Drama</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Tommy Wiseau</span>                                        <span>Starring Juliette Danielle, Tommy Wiseau, Greg Sestero</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p><strong><u>PLEASE NOTE: <em>Tommy Wiseau will NOT be in attendance for these screenings!!!&nbsp;</em></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Oh hai Prince Charles Cinema website visitor&hellip;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tommy Wiseau&#39;s &quot;masterpiece&quot; The Room has been hailed as the biggest cult film since Rocky Horror.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So bad it&#39;s good, it&#39;s drawn a cult following in the US with viewers acting out skits, storming out in disgust, and throwing plastic cutlery during screenings. However unlike other cult films such as Rocky Horror, or the Big Lebowski, these fans are drawn to how bad they regard the film to be! Come and see the birth of a cult with it&#39;s poor score, terrible acting and internet meme generating script.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Links <a href=\"http://www.TheRoomMovie.com\">www.TheRoomMovie.com</a> - <a href=\"http://www.theroommovie.com/roomtrailer2.html\">Official Trailer</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>&quot;If a lot of people love each other the world will be a better place to live.&quot; </em>- Tommy Wiseau&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>&quot;The Room&quot; is not a movie IT IS THE EVENT!</em> - Tommy Wiseau&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Johnny is a successful banker who lives happily in a San Francisco townhouse with his fianc&eacute;e, Lisa. One day, inexplicably, she gets bored of him and decides to seduce Johnny&#39;s best friend, Mark. From there, nothing will be the same again.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>American Footballs and metal Spoons are prohibited from all screenings of THE ROOM. If you bring either,&nbsp;they will be confiscated by security. Failure to comply with this rule could result in your&nbsp;removal from the screening and a lifetime ban from the PCC.</em></strong></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Tuesday 6th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628241\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:50 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 19th November</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628242\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:50 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617460/halloween-iii-season-of-the-witch\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/nod80NlrWD0Z2BlS74Nm2zyhpoKTMVEBRnLFoXcw_xU.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617460/halloween-iii-season-of-the-witch\" target=\"\">Halloween III: Season of the Witch</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1982</span>                                        <span>98mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Tommy Lee Wallace</span>                                        <span>Starring Tom Atkins, Stacey Nelkin, Dan O'Herlihy</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>After a terrified toy salesman is mysteriously attacked and brought to the hospital clutching the year's most popular Halloween mask, Dr. Daniel Challis sets out to investigate the strange events and finds himself thrust into a nightmarish conspiracy.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627715\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 10th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627717\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 21st October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627511\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 23rd October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627718\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:35 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Monday 26th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627656\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:50 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639034/childs-play-1988\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/UwzbZPruMLVa3iyqiukv0S9Yju9vfonYJn-6iCkdWHE.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639034/childs-play-1988\" target=\"\">Child&#039;s Play (1988)</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1988</span>                                        <span>87mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Tom Holland</span>                                        <span>Starring Catherine Hicks, Chris Sarandon, Alex Vincent, Brad Dourif</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>When serial killer Charles Lee Ray (Brad Dourif) is mortally wounded in a police shoot-out, he uses a voodoo spell to transfer his soul into Chucky, an innocuous ‘Good Guys' doll. Young Andy (Alex Vincent) receives him as a birthday gift, and Chucky soon embarks on a killing spree. However, Charles doesn't want to be trapped in the body of the doll forever; escape is possible by transferring his personality into the first human he reveals his identity to... and naturally Andy is curious about his new toy.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627548\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617164/mystery-horror-movie\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/31617164.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617164/mystery-horror-movie\" target=\"\">Mystery Horror Movie</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1896</span>                                        <span>95mins</span>                                        <span>We can't tell you</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Who Knows?</span>                                        <span>Starring It's a Secret</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>HorrOctober invades our&nbsp;Mystery Movie strand this October! We&#39;ll be serving up four Mystery Horror Movies over four weeks! That is the only hint we will give you! No other hints. No clues. No refunds!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can find a list of every MYSTERY MOVIE we have ever screened&nbsp;<a href=\"https://letterboxd.com/thepcc/list/every-film-that-has-been-featured-in-a-mystery/\">HERE</a>; if a film is on this list, it is not eligible for future Mystery Movie screenings!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent Advice : As these films are a mystery, we aren&#39;t able to provide specific ratings / guidance on the film&#39;s content. We strongly advise that you take this into consideration before purchasing a ticket.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627547\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 14th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627574\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:40 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 21st October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627613\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 28th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627669\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">9:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617533/cameron-winter-at-carnegie-hall\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/Z1KNBRTCmNDmJrz0pzReMR4_0ofPtk8vJ4XzibLxmr0.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617533/cameron-winter-at-carnegie-hall\" target=\"\">Cameron Winter at Carnegie Hall</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>71mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Concert Film</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Paul Thomas Anderson</span>                                        <span>Starring Cameron Winter</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/making-marie-antoinette-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>One Battle After Another director Paul Thomas Anderson creates an intimate document of Geese frontman Cameron Winter&rsquo;s solo piano performance at the legendary New York concert hall.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>In December 2025, Paul Thomas Anderson collaborated with fellow filmmaker Benny Safdie on a multi-perspective and multi-format recording of Winter&#39;s solo performance. The warm hues capture the feeling in the room, including audience reactions, to create an immersive cinematic experience for those of us who couldn&rsquo;t be there. It&#39;s a rapturous celebration of live performance, whose appeal should reach far beyond the band and Winter&#39;s existing fan base.</em></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?doWork::WScontent::loadArticle=Load&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::article_id=DC54AE36-BB73-476A-8094-6122168781F4&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617522/land-of-hope-and-gory-shorts-programme\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/KaIrB3hE6HWW5FKcSou5iz6JwTuUfk3uDh5OT4_9FGo.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617522/land-of-hope-and-gory-shorts-programme\" target=\"\">Land of Hope and Gory [Shorts Programme]</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>89mins</span>                                                                                <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                                                                                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/land-of-hope-and-gory-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the body-horror side-effects of pushing yourself too far to an intense ski ride and some grisly cooking ideas, the way we spend our time has never appeared so strange.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>FILMS IN THE PROGRAMME:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The Sorrows of Young Charlotte</strong><br />\r\nDirector- Shir Ariya<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 13min<br />\r\nWhen Werther finds Charlie&rsquo;s ex-boyfriend&rsquo;s potency pills in the bathroom, he takes a double dose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Meatmylk</strong><br />\r\nDirector-&nbsp;Lucy Luscombe<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 15min<br />\r\nA personal trainer decides to bulk-up with a new protein shake, only to discover that it has side effects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Fishbrain</strong><br />\r\nDirector&nbsp;-&nbsp;Max Vanderspuy<br />\r\nUSA - 2026&nbsp;- 22min<br />\r\nTrapped in her decaying coastal town and desperate to escape, Ori feeds her stubborn grandfather tainted fish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>All Yours</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Sophia Di Martino<br />\r\nUK - 2025&nbsp;- 8min<br />\r\nAfter discovering her skin is peeling off, a bored mother is compelled to bake it into little pastries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The Last Snow</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Rodolphe Bouquet-Populus<br />\r\nFrance - 2025&nbsp;- 19min<br />\r\nIn a ski resort where snow is starting to disappear, Isabelle and Guillaume find themselves stuck on a chairlift.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Man Eating Pussy</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Emily Lawson<br />\r\nCanada&nbsp;- 2026 - 12min<br />\r\nA dying man seeks comfort in a mysterious sex worker whose monstrous anatomy offers pleasure and the ultimate release.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 7th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/land-of-hope-and-gory-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617465/zombie-flesh-eaters-zombi-2\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/tX6OdoNXpzdYhsJq4bBsOB_HmOTQEJ_68yoWtNGq3Xc.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617465/zombie-flesh-eaters-zombi-2\" target=\"\">Zombie Flesh Eaters [Zombi 2]</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1979</span>                                        <span>91mins</span>                                        <span>Italy</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Lucio Fulci</span>                                        <span>Starring Tisa Farrow, Ian McCulloch, Richard Johnson</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>After an abandoned boat sails into New York harbor with a zombie aboard, a reporter teams up with the daughter of the boat's missing captain to investigate the island where he was last seen conducting research—the site of an alleged zombie outbreak.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 8th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627554\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 25th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627645\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/8262359/house-of-1000-corpses\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/bRnsnapKp18klHZkKr1wTJSxkdNdxZ-QDU0sLG4oRbU.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/8262359/house-of-1000-corpses\" target=\"\">House of 1000 Corpses</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2003</span>                                        <span>89mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Rob Zombie</span>                                        <span>Starring Sid Haig, Sheri Moon Zombie, Karen Black, Bill Moseley</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Two young couples traveling across the backwoods of Texas searching for urban legends of murder end up as prisoners of a bizarre and sadistic backwater family of serial killers.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 8th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627556\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617493/making-marie-antoinette\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/UpYvp2JJueqIspsah0jkFNnFr_us-dq9bJUE51MTLY8.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617493/making-marie-antoinette\" target=\"\">Making Marie Antoinette</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>86mins</span>                                                                                <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Eleanor Coppola</span>                                                                            </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/making-marie-antoinette-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Eleanor Coppola&rsquo;s documentary on the making of Marie Antoinette is a rousing love letter to filmic craft and the joys and complexities of leading an artistic life.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Drawn from over 80 hours of footage, Coppola&rsquo;s insightful eye is complimented by her production diaries (voiced by Diane Lane) which form the narrative spine of this profound exploration of creativity, the unique pressures placed on female artists and maternal love. The beauty of her words gives pause, not only to the ambitious artistry onscreen, but the historical character at the centre of this fiction.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This screening will be presented with Descriptive Subtitles.&nbsp;</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 8th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/making-marie-antoinette-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617466/the-devils-rejects\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/yHDQGO7AlVwC3EjzwC5paPD9dGBBsQ2ZFpPYvOeO6tw.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617466/the-devils-rejects\" target=\"\">The Devil&#039;s Rejects</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2005</span>                                        <span>107mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Rob Zombie</span>                                        <span>Starring Sid Haig, Bill Moseley, Sheri Moon Zombie</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>The murderous, backwoods Firefly family take to the road to escape the vengeful Sheriff Wydell, who is not afraid of being as ruthless as his target.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 8th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627557\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Monday 19th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627600\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617524/call-your-bluff-shorts-programme\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/gYlcXpzMaZwmOHh-K6ZKAsmZNg4sVXDAaG-Iwmi35y8.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617524/call-your-bluff-shorts-programme\" target=\"\">Call Your Bluff [Shorts Programme]</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                                                                <span>93mins</span>                                                                                <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                                                                                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/call-your-bluff-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Whether it&rsquo;s cutting your own hair, winning the lottery, looking for love or livening up a dull day at work, these uk shorts will cover all your comedy needs.</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>FILMS IN THE PROGRAMME:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>A Twist of Hate</strong><br />\r\nDirector-&nbsp;Maddy Shenai<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 9min<br />\r\nNewlyweds encounter an unusual lawyer who probes their motivations for love.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Date Night</strong><br />\r\nDirector-&nbsp;Tanya Reynolds<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 16min<br />\r\nDanielle and Harry&#39;s latest attempt at kinky roleplay shines a discomforting light on what they really want from life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Laundreams</strong><br />\r\nDirector&nbsp;-&nbsp;Amber Gadd, Evie Ward-Drummond<br />\r\nUSA - 2026&nbsp;- 15min<br />\r\nIn an empty laundrette manned by 20-year-olds Minnie and Leah, nothing ever happens and nothing ever changes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Micro Bangs</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Iris Breward<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 5min<br />\r\nA woman starts to spiral as she considers a drastic haircut.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Sweet Bitter Sweet</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Nicolee Tsin<br />\r\nUK - 2025&nbsp;- 9min<br />\r\nAfter moving to London, a young Chinese woman searches for love while working at a bakery.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The Devil Is In Me</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Tia Salisbury<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 11min<br />\r\nIn late 18th-century England, a nightmarish teenager and a rookie reverend lock horns over Sunday school attendance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>A Kind of Purity</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Theo Shivdasani<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 15min<br />\r\nAt an art gallery, a disillusioned assistant&#39;s pretence of normality is pushed to breaking point when a sudden act takes place.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>How To Hide It</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Ramla Ali, Richard A. Moore<br />\r\nUK - 2025&nbsp;- 13min<br />\r\nAfter winning the lottery, a woman faces tension between dreams of a better life and her deeply held beliefs.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 8th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/call-your-bluff-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639130/dont-look-now\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3639130.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639130/dont-look-now\" target=\"\">Don&#039;t Look Now</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1973</span>                                        <span>110mins</span>                                        <span>Italy, UK</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Mystery</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Nicolas Roeg</span>                                        <span>Starring Donald Sutherland, Hilary Mason, Julie Christie</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>After the death of their child, a couple moves to Venice, where the husband has an assignment of restoring a church. There, they meet a sister who claims their kid is trying to warn them of a danger.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627716\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:20 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639327/the-craft\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3639327.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3639327/the-craft\" target=\"\">The Craft</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1996</span>                                        <span>101mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Teen / Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Andrew Fleming</span>                                        <span>Starring Fairuza Balk, Robin Tunney, Neve Campbell</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>After transferring to a Los Angeles high school, Sarah (Robin Tunney) finds that her telekinetic gift appeals to a group of three wannabe witches, who happen to be seeking a fourth member for their rituals. Bonnie (Neve Campbell), Rochelle (Rachel True) and Nancy (Fairuza Balk), like Sarah herself, all have troubled backgrounds, which combined with their nascent powers lead to dangerous consequences. When a minor spell causes a fellow student to lose her hair, the girls grow power-mad.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627560\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Monday 12th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627564\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Thursday 15th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627582\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617523/life-drawing-shorts-programme\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/H7Ie_tmN12ZB3WVrTSmLDZPcGHbgp4eVnSYmxw8MJS4.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617523/life-drawing-shorts-programme\" target=\"\">Life / Drawing [Shorts Programme]</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>96mins</span>                                        <span>Czech Republic, Finland, France, Norway, Sweden</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                                                                                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/life-drawing-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>A selection of animated shorts exploring what connects us to people, the world around us and, most importantly, ourselves.</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>FILMS IN THE PROGRAMME:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Babyface</strong><br />\r\nDirector-&nbsp;Sacha Beeley<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 6min<br />\r\nSpoon finds a coupon!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Dance of the Spirits</strong><br />\r\nDirector-&nbsp;Andreea-Lorena Florea<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 6min<br />\r\nA young shepherd boy, living in rural Romania, finds more comfort among his sheep than with his dad.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Eyeliner</strong><br />\r\nDirector&nbsp;-&nbsp;Aisha Boudjillouli<br />\r\nUK&nbsp;- 2026&nbsp;- 8min<br />\r\nWhen two friends receive different receptions to wearing eyeliner, Nina discovers that her journey as a trans girl might not be so easy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Dummy</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Adrian Maganza<br />\r\nUK - 2026&nbsp;- 7min<br />\r\nEveryone forgets the rescue dummy that&#39;s left at the bottom of a swimming pool.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Film Film</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Arturs Voblikovs<br />\r\nUK - 2025&nbsp;- 12min<br />\r\nA print-shop owner with seasonal depression becomes obsessed with copying the life of his new customer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>I Was Kidnapped!</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Dhananjay Barangule<br />\r\nUK-Latvia - 2026&nbsp;- 7min<br />\r\nDhananjay enjoys recounting stories from his childhood when it slowly starts to dawn on him how they may have affected his mum.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>PLEASE</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Anna Mantzaris<br />\r\nSweden-France-Czech Republic&nbsp;- 2026&nbsp;- 8min<br />\r\nIn a big city, several characters looking for affection are plunged into situations that are absurd, comical and moving.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The Bird&#39;s Placebo</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Rami Jarboui<br />\r\nTunisia - 2025&nbsp;- 20min<br />\r\nTold through rotoscope and 3D animation, a young man from a marginalised neighborhood in Tunisia&rsquo;s capital dreams of crossing the Mediterranean.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The Clouds of Odessa</strong><br />\r\nDirector -&nbsp;Luca Arcangeli<br />\r\nItaly&nbsp;- 2026 - 13min<br />\r\nA Ukrainian director thinks about the film, a love story, that she would have liked to make but that she may never be able to.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Fantasies of a Rescue Dummy</strong><br />\r\nDirector - Adrian Maganza<br />\r\nU.K - 2025&nbsp;- 7min<br />\r\nEveryone forgets the rescue dummy that&#39;s left at the bottom of a swimming pool.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/life-drawing-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617494/the-fox\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/PrtfGW7sCfVOPtyReudE6SSU-Da5nCMP1jvEAgQH-2A.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617494/the-fox\" target=\"\">The Fox</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>90mins</span>                                        <span>Australia</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Dario Russo</span>                                        <span>Starring Emily Browning, Jai Courtney, Olivia Colman</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/fox-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>A talking fox, voiced by Olivia Colman, persuades a hunter to transform his cheating wife into an ideal spouse, in this gleefully outrageous, shape-shifting comedy.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>As revenge for adultery, who wouldn&rsquo;t take a talking fox&rsquo;s advice to throw your cheating partner into a magical outback hole with transformative powers? Dario Russo&rsquo;s sly, irreverent black comedy mercilessly satirises our baser animal instincts, and is played straight by a terrifically committed cast that includes Jai Courtney and Emily Browning, alongside the vocal talents of Colman and the late, great Sam Neill.</em></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Friday 9th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/fox-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 11th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/fox-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617532/inherit\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/HUXWPlPPs8t5sqB9SIOejTnF7p6kpY0OnmnJ87ZZTv0.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617532/inherit\" target=\"\">Inherit</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>128mins</span>                                        <span>Thailand</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Banjong Pisanthanakun</span>                                        <span>Starring Davika Hoorne, Thitiya Jirapornsilp, Sinjai Plengpanich</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/making-marie-antoinette-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>A rich Thai family falls apart with the arrival of a distant relative in Banjong Pisanthanakun&#39;s (The Medium, LFF 2021) gripping and unpredictable new horror.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Grandma Woranart is full of surprises. She claims to be 80, but has the face of a beautiful young woman. That turns out to be the tip of the iceberg, as family secrets are gradually revealed and it becomes all too apparent that something sinister lurks inside this seemingly benign relative. Featuring a magnetic performance by Davika Hoorne (A Useful Ghost), Inherit thrills as much as it chills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThai Language with English subtitles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent Warning:&nbsp;Contains scenes of graphic violence or injury, self-harm, and sex.</em></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 10th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?doWork::WScontent::loadArticle=Load&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::article_id=E556F281-DAA0-48F4-AB3F-1F2AC2CEECC5&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">11:10 am</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3645703/psycho\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/3645703.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/3645703/psycho\" target=\"\">Psycho</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1960</span>                                        <span>108mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Alfred Hitchcock</span>                                        <span>Starring Anthony Perkins, Janet Leigh, Vera Miles</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Phoenix secretary Marion Crane (Janet Leigh), on the lam after stealing $40,000 from her employer in order to run away with her boyfriend, Sam Loomis (John Gavin), is overcome by exhaustion during a heavy rainstorm. Traveling on the back roads to avoid the police, she stops for the night at the ramshackle Bates Motel and meets the polite but highly strung proprietor Norman Bates (Anthony Perkins), a young man with an interest in taxidermy and a difficult relationship with his mother.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 10th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627520\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 23rd October</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627624\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 4k\">4K</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617495/musk\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/7nKTH3erkIS_z4VYI-iMZtT6JQsnhjocyxKbW5bNZCM.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617495/musk\" target=\"\">Musk</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>225mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Alex Gibney</span>                                                                            </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/musk-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>In this riveting documentary portrait, Academy Award&reg;-winning filmmaker Alex Gibney brings insight and a fearlessness in peeling away the many layers of Elon Musk&rsquo;s world.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Like his Enron: The Smartest Guys in the Room, Oscar-winning Taxi to the Dark Side and Mea Maxima Culpa: Silence in the House of God, Gibney brings a forensic eye to the life and career of the richest &ndash; and certainly one of the most divisive &ndash; figures in contemporary life. There is also intelligence and no small amount of wit to the way he frames his approach, resulting in a film that&rsquo;s sure to start conversations.</em></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 10th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/musk-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">2:05 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617496/nightborn\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/2Z2b6BECXAOHrgaaA_fY0N0DKmLdYNGN3mGUmFAfvV4.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617496/nightborn\" target=\"\">Nightborn</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>92mins</span>                                        <span>Finland, France, Lithuania, UK</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Hanna Bergholm</span>                                        <span>Starring Rupert Grint, Seidi Haarla, Pamela Tola</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/nightborn-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>A couple&rsquo;s dream of idyllic family life in the Finnish woods is shattered by the arrival of their nightmarish new baby, in Hanna Bergholm&rsquo;s riotously gory folk horror.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Drawing deeply from the wells of folk horror and psychological post-natal angst, director Bergholm pits Seidi Haarla and Rupert Grint&rsquo;s new parents against their hairy, howling offspring, which displays a taste for raw meat over milk. Gruesome and bloody, it&rsquo;s also chock-full of self-aware humour that surely guarantees the film&rsquo;s place as a future cult classic.</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnglish and Finnish Language with some English subtitles</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Content warning:&nbsp;Contains scenes of graphic violence or injury and harm towards children.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 10th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/nightborn-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:40 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617497/hot-spot\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/bQLMPVr4Mkxa_ZwFF-_gsJmnhHTob_EMIlGAiKDzh_I.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617497/hot-spot\" target=\"\">Hot Spot</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>101mins</span>                                        <span>Greece, Poland</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Agnieszka Smoczynska</span>                                        <span>Starring Andrzej Konopka, Noomi Rapace, Reika Kirishima</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/hot-spot-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The new film from the acclaimed director of The Silent Twins is a daring and distinctive sci-fi thriller set in a near-future society ruled by sentient AI.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Djonny, a vibrantly dressed private eye, is called to solve a mysterious murder case, only to discover a rebel group capable of undermining the digital overlord led by Rana, who may or may not be a cyber witch. Agnieszka Smoczynska creates a hypnotic, dystopian world that lures you in with its breathtaking aesthetics and hallucinatory images.</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnglish, Japanese Language and Polish Language&nbsp;with some English Subtitles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent Warning: Contains flashing images</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 10th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/hot-spot-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">9:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617498/wild-horse-nine\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/3gS5_gPqqmklhSp6HqcwiP9JINrfcvlLCDsX2BJC29I.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617498/wild-horse-nine\" target=\"\">Wild Horse Nine</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>118mins</span>                                        <span>Chile, UK, USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Martin McDonagh</span>                                        <span>Starring John Malkovich, Sam Rockwell, Steve Buscemi, Tom Waits, Parker Posey</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/wild-horse-nine-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Martin McDonagh continues to mine the absurdities and complexities of male relationships in a film that brims with energy and is sure to delight.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>On the cusp of dictator Augusto Pinochet taking power in Chile, a trio of CIA agents snipe and bicker as they await the &lsquo;go&rsquo; date on their part in yet another military coup. However, against the stunning natural beauty and mysterious ancient artefacts of Easter Island, their plan starts to unravel. John Malkovich&rsquo;s peerless performance chimes beautifully with co-stars Sam Rockwell and Steve Buscemi, who together bring McDonagh&rsquo;s brilliantly acerbic and witty script hilariously to life.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>English and Spanish Language with English Subtitles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis screening will be presented with Descriptive Subtitles and will have Audio Description available on request.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent Warning: Contains scenes of drug use and graphic violence or injury.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 11th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?doWork::WScontent::loadArticle=Load&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::article_id=2ED23CFF-23C4-416C-833E-9482A7FC9735&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617499/the-liberation\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/6So1tQQLnelifANqhcQGWkJESylPbJ30NnB0OYqitEI.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617499/the-liberation\" target=\"\">The Liberation</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>119mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Guy Nattiv</span>                                        <span>Starring Carrie Coon, Lily James, Bella Ramsey</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/liberation-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>In Guy Nattiv&rsquo;s tense, probing film, two young women attempt to extract their mother from a cult, but find themselves susceptible to its mysterious leader.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Carrie Coon has never been better than she is as Rita, who lives an &lsquo;ordinary&rsquo; life as a bank teller, wife and mother. But beneath the veneer of this seemingly ordinary life, she hides the deep trauma of being a holocaust survivor. When she falls into the orbit of the seductive Ricki (a compelling Lily James), Rita finds the space to heal. But at what cost to her family?</em></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 11th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/liberation-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">5:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/28408781/black-swan\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://posters-uk.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/PRILON/28408781.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/28408781/black-swan\" target=\"\">Black Swan</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2010</span>                                        <span>108mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Horror / Thriller</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Darren Aronofsky</span>                                        <span>Starring Vincent Cassel, Natalie Portman, Winona Ryder, Barbara Hershey, Mila Kunis</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Nina, a ballerina, gets the chance to play the White Swan, Princess Odette. But she finds herself slipping into madness when Thomas, the artistic director, decides that Lily might fit the role better.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 11th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627501\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617500/hachan-shake-your-booty\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/uqlZvfCpOlYfqrLV-mdnJZE1QBUlIXDft9W716DgUgM.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617500/hachan-shake-your-booty\" target=\"\">Ha-Chan, Shake Your Booty!</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2026</span>                                        <span>122mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Josef Kubota Wladyka</span>                                        <span>Starring Rinko Kikuchi, Alberto Guerra, Alejandro Edda</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/ha-chan-shake-your-booty-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Recently widowed Haru rediscovers her love for ballroom dancing, only to find herself attracted to her new instructor, in this zany, toe-tapping film.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Haru (an excellent Rinko Kikuchi) loves ballroom dancing. But after tragedy strikes, she retreats into isolation. Her concerned friends convince her to return to the studio, where she soon becomes infatuated with a new instructor. With Haru throwing caution to the wind, director Josef Kubota Wladyka delivers an exploration of grief that is bold, surprisingly playful and crowd-pleasing.</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnglish and Japanese Language with some English subtitles</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 11th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/ha-chan-shake-your-booty-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">8:10 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row 35mm 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617501/ken-russells-the-devils-the-directors-cut\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/TvpvvMLZE--On4VPC7kPWLPu4xlQRGy_HJLswXUWscM.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617501/ken-russells-the-devils-the-directors-cut\" target=\"\">Ken Russell&#039;s The Devils: The Director&#039;s Cut</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1971</span>                                        <span>114mins</span>                                        <span>UK</span>                                        <span>(18)</span>                                        <span>LFF</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Ken Russell</span>                                        <span>Starring Vanessa Redgrave, Oliver Reed, Gemma Jones, Dudley Sutton</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>LFF Tickets Are Only Available via BFI London Film Festival Website from Tuesday 17&nbsp;September 2026&nbsp;10:00am: <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/devils-lff26\">Click Here To Book</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"color:#2ecc71\"><em><strong>Following the LFF performance on 12th October, Ken Russell&#39;s THE DEVILS will screen daily from 30th October. Screenings from both 35mm and Digital. 35mm performances will be noted next to the time. If there is no note next to the time, the performance is Digital. Tickets on sale to PCC Members Friday 25th September 00:00 for 24hrs (on sale to everyone Saturday 26th September 00:00).&nbsp;</strong></em></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Censored for over half a century, Ken Russell&rsquo;s film returns in a landmark director&rsquo;s cut reconstruction that reveals the full power of his original vision.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Inspired by the true story of 17th-century priest Urbain Grandier, accused of bewitching a convent of nuns, The Devils lays bare the collusion of church and state through a searing vision of religious persecution, collective hysteria and institutional corruption. The restoration many believed would never happen reaffirms Russell&rsquo;s incendiary masterpiece as among the most overwhelming and uncompromising achievements in British cinema.</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Assembled from original camera negative, this 4k restoration is Ken Russell&rsquo;s 2004 preferred edit. Picture and sound restoration by Warner Bros. Post Production Creative Services, Water Tower Color and Warner Bros. Sound.</em></p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Monday 12th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/article/devils-lff26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">6:00 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Friday 30th October</div>                                                <li class=\"\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628200\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">12:15 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\">                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628201\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">5:45 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 31st October</div>                                                <li class=\"35mm\">\n                                                    \n                                                                              