ss=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1988</span>                                        <span>131mins</span>                                        <span>USA</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Christmas / Action</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by John McTiernan</span>                                        <span>Starring Alan Rickman, Bonnie Bedelia, Bruce Willis</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>New York City policeman John McClane (Bruce Willis) is visiting his estranged wife (Bonnie Bedelia) and two daughters on Christmas Eve. He joins her at a holiday party in the headquarters of the Japanese-owned business she works for. But the festivities are interrupted by a group of terrorists who take over the exclusive high-rise, and everyone in it. Very soon McClane realizes that there&#39;s no one to save the hostages -- but him.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Friday 4th December</div>                                                <li class=\"4k\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628006\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                