                  <span>Starring Kal Penn, John Cho, Neil Patrick Harris</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p>Six years after their Guantanamo Bay adventure, stoner buds Harold Lee and Kumar Patel cause a holiday fracas by inadvertently burning down Harold's father-in-law's prize Christmas tree.</p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Wednesday 16th December</div>                                                <li class=\"1-mem\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31628125\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n                                                            <span class=\"time\">3:30 pm</span>\n                                                        </a>                                                    <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 1-mem\">£1 MEM</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                 \n    </div>\n</div>\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t